      <activity id="6639c438-1317-5be2-a00d-66be6d4c4a1d" activityNameId="b6b12f69-cc12-5a3d-b36a-0e472d3c30c0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Industrial residue wood, softwood, air, kiln dried, u=6%, holzpur, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Industrial residue wood, softwood, air, kiln dried, u=6%, holzpur, at plant
The economic allocation of the process to the two coproducts holzpur and industrial residue wood is done according to specific data on the volume shares and prices of the products. Data on the energy and material use are specific for the Walter Küng AG, which produces holzpur elements. The manufacturing plant is modelled by a sawmill.;
UUID: 78072749-660e-33cd-9b22-f79e49cac4a7
Includes transport from the sawmill to the manufacturing plant and the manufacturing of holzpur elements from sawn timber.
Location: Data apply to the Walter Küng AG in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at the Walter Küng AG in Alpnach-Dorf (Switzerland). 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_78072749-660e-33cd-9b22-f79e49cac4a7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
